Package: mcpstudio
Title: MCP Access to the RStudio Editor
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person(
    "Randell", "Smith",
    email = "73455700+Catpockets@users.noreply.github.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Description: Provides a local Model Context Protocol server that exposes
    deliberate, annotated tools for inspecting and modifying live 'RStudio'
    editor buffers and for executing bounded R code in the active session.
    The server uses standard input and output plus authenticated same-user
    inter-process communication; it does not open a network listener.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/Catpockets/mcp-servers/tree/main/servers/rstudio-editor
BugReports: https://github.com/Catpockets/mcp-servers/issues
